<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">

  <title>About AQUIPLEX — Building context-aware AI</title>
  <meta name="description" content="AQUIPLEX is an AI company building the world's most context-aware AI. Our mission is to create AI that truly understands your digital world. Our product is Aqua AI.">
  <meta name="author" content="AQUIPLEX">

  <link rel="canonical" href="https://aquiplex.com/about" />

  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <meta property="og:site_name" content="AQUIPLEX">
  <meta property="og:title" content="About AQUIPLEX">
  <meta property="og:description" content="We're building the world's most context-aware AI. Aqua AI is where that work meets people today.">
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://aquiplex.com/about">
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://aquiplex.com/og/og-cover.png">
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">

  <link rel="icon" href="/logo/favicon.ico" sizes="any">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="48x48" href="/logo/favicon-48x48.png">
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/logo/apple-touch-icon.png">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@450;550;600&family=Newsreader:opsz,wght@6..72,400;6..72,500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/platform.css">
</head>
<body class="px-page">

  <a href="#main" class="px-skip">Skip to content</a>

  <%- include("partials/nav", { pxFonts: false }) %>

  <main id="main">

    <section class="px-page-hero">
      <div class="px-container">
        <div class="px-eyebrow">About AQUIPLEX</div>
        <h1>We&rsquo;re building the world&rsquo;s most context-aware AI.</h1>
        <p>AQUIPLEX is an AI company. Our product, Aqua AI, is a personal thinking system &mdash; and the place where our work on context-aware AI meets people today.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="px-section">
      <div class="px-container">
        <dl class="px-vm px-reveal">
          <div class="px-vm-item">
            <dt>Our vision</dt>
            <dd>Build the world&rsquo;s most context-aware AI.</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="px-vm-item">
            <dt>Our mission</dt>
            <dd>Create AI that truly understands your digital world.</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="px-section">
      <div class="px-container">
        <div class="px-sec-head px-reveal">
          <div class="px-eyebrow">Why we exist</div>
          <h2>Useful help depends on context.</h2>
          <p>People&rsquo;s work is spread across conversations, documents, plans and decisions. An assistant that sees only the current prompt leaves the person to carry all of that &mdash; and to explain it again, every time.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="px-sec-head px-reveal" style="margin-bottom:0">
          <p>We think AI should be able to hold more of that context, carefully and on the person&rsquo;s terms, so effort goes into the thinking rather than the re-explaining. Over time, we want that to grow into an AI that maintains a genuine, evolving understanding of the world you work in &mdash; and uses it to help before you have to ask.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="px-section">
      <div class="px-container">
        <div class="px-sec-head px-reveal">
          <div class="px-eyebrow">What we build</div>
          <img src="/logo/aqua-ai-192.png" alt="" width="56" height="56" style="display:block;border-radius:13px;margin:0 0 18px;">
          <h2>Aqua AI.</h2>
          <p>Aqua AI is our personal thinking system. Tell it what you&rsquo;re working on and share the documents that matter; it carries that context into later conversations, shows where each thing it remembers came from, and lets you correct or delete any of it. It is available on Android and on the web.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="px-btn-row px-reveal">
          <a href="<%= PLAY_STORE_URL %>" class="px-btn px-btn-primary px-btn-lg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Download Aqua AI on Google Play (opens in a new tab)">Download Aqua AI</a>
          <a href="/landing#aqua" class="px-btn px-btn-secondary px-btn-lg">How Aqua works</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="px-section">
      <div class="px-container">
        <div class="px-sec-head px-reveal">
          <div class="px-eyebrow">How we build</div>
          <h2>Principles we hold ourselves to.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="px-steps">
          <div class="px-step px-reveal">
            <span class="px-step-num">01</span>
            <h3>Honest about what it knows</h3>
            <p>Aqua knows only what you tell it or upload. It shows where each thing it remembers came from, and we describe what it does today separately from what we are still building.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="px-step px-reveal">
            <span class="px-step-num">02</span>
            <h3>You stay in control</h3>
            <p>Everything Aqua remembers about you is visible on one page. You can correct any of it, and delete one item or all of it.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="px-step px-reveal">
            <span class="px-step-num">03</span>
            <h3>Understanding is earned</h3>
            <p>Nothing is assumed on day one. Aqua&rsquo;s understanding grows from what you share, and we would rather show progress than promise it.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <hr class="px-waterline" aria-hidden="true">
    <section class="px-cta">
      <div class="px-container px-reveal">
        <h2>Meet Aqua AI.</h2>
        <p>The personal thinking system from AQUIPLEX.</p>
        <div class="px-btn-row center">
          <a href="<%= PLAY_STORE_URL %>" class="px-btn px-btn-primary px-btn-lg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Download Aqua AI on Google Play (opens in a new tab)">Download Aqua AI</a>
          <a href="/founders" class="px-btn px-btn-secondary px-btn-lg">Meet the founders</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <%- include("partials/footer") %>

  <script>
    (function () {
      if (!('IntersectionObserver' in window)) {
        document.querySelectorAll('.px-reveal').forEach(function (el) { el.classList.add('in'); });
        return;
      }
      var io = new IntersectionObserver(function (entries) {
        entries.forEach(function (e) {
          if (e.isIntersecting) { e.target.classList.add('in'); io.unobserve(e.target); }
        });
      }, { threshold: 0.12 });
      document.querySelectorAll('.px-reveal').forEach(function (el) { io.observe(el); });
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
